gin="01:48.707" end="01:48.875">i</span><span begin="01:48.875" end="01:49.491">ta't</span><span begin="01:49.491" end="01:49.691">te</span><span begin="01:49.691" end="01:51.041">yowasa</span><span begin="01:51.041" end="01:51.362">ga</span></text><text for="L29"><span begin="01:54.387" end="01:55.810">soumatoumi</span><span begin="01:55.810" end="01:56.344">takuha</span><span begin="01:56.344" end="01:57.210">shi't</span><span begin="01:57.210" end="01:57.493">te</span><span begin="01:57.493" end="01:57.944">nan</span><span begin="01:57.944" end="01:58.633">domo</span></text><text for="L30"><span begin="01:58.864" end="01:59.664">naga</span><span begin="01:59.664" end="02:00.016">me</span><span begin="02:00.016" end="02:00.438">te</span></text><text for="L32"><span begin="02:02.311" end="02:03.833">kokorowo</span><span begin="02:04.033" end="02:04.633">kara</span><span begin="02:04.633" end="02:05.100">shita</span><span begin="02:05.100" end="02:05.601">'tte</span></text><text for="L33"><span begin="02:05.703" end="02:07.045">kakonika</span><span begin="02:07.045" end="02:07.545">wa</span><span begin="02:07.717" end="02:09.392">rufutari</span></text><text for="L36"><span begin="02:28.721" end="02:29.791">hodo</span><span begin="02:29.791" end="02:29.975">i</span><span begin="02:29.975" end="02:30.641">ta't</span><span begin="02:30.641" end="02:30.823">te</span><span begin="02:30.823" end="02:32.156">yowasa</span><span begin="02:32.156" end="02:32.509">ga</span></text><text for="L38"><span begin="02:35.488" end="02:36.908">soumatoumi</span><span begin="02:36.908" end="02:37.445">taku</span><span begin="02:37.445" end="02:38.311">hashi't</span><span begin="02:38.311" end="02:38.594">te</span><span begin="02:38.594" end="02:39.045">nan</span><span begin="02:39.045" end="02:39.704">domo</span></text><text for="L39"><span begin="02:40.034" end="02:40.837">naga</span><span begin="02:40.837" end="02:41.120">me</span><span begin="02:41.120" end="02:41.610">te</span></text><text for="L41"><span begin="02:43.407" end="02:44.951">kokorowo</span><span begin="02:45.161" end="02:45.795">kara</span><span begin="02:45.795" end="02:46.227">shita</span><span begin="02:46.227" end="02:46.822">'tte</span></text><text for="L42"><span begin="02:46.940" end="02:48.167">kakonika</span><span begin="02:48.167" end="02:48.697">wa</span><span begin="02:48.850" end="02:50.534">rufutari</span></text></transliteration></transliterations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="03:02.772"><div begin="00:13.392" end="02:54.570"><p begin="00:13.392" end="00:14.487" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:13.392" end="00:13.701">ほ</span><span begin="00:13.701" end="00:14.487">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你听 雨滴再次淅淅沥沥落下</span></p><p begin="00:15.096" end="00:16.292" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:15.096" end="00:15.446">ま</span><span begin="00:15.446" end="00:16.292">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">又一次</span></p><p begin="00:16.871" end="00:19.790" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:16.871" end="00:17.125">落</span><span begin="00:17.125" end="00:18.581">ち</span><span begin="00:18.581" end="00:18.863">てい</span><span begin="00:18.863" end="00:19.790">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纷扬坠落的</span></p><p begin="00:20.330" end="00:21.492" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:20.330" end="00:21.492">雨</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">雨</span></p><p begin="00:21.972" end="00:25.466" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:21.972" end="00:23.327">消え</span><span begin="00:23.769" end="00:24.020">てい</span><span begin="00:24.020" end="00:25.466">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那雨声 已渐渐远去消散</span></p><p begin="00:25.466" end="00:26.583" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:25.466" end="00:26.583">音</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">声</span></p><p begin="00:26.915" end="00:33.568" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:26.915" end="00:27.373">もう</span><span begin="00:27.373" end="00:28.824">ど</span><span begin="00:28.824" end="00:29.157">んな</span><span begin="00:29.157" end="00:29.873">に</span><span begin="00:30.326" end="00:32.294">叫</span><span begin="00:32.294" end="00:32.609">んで</span><span begin="00:32.609" end="00:33.568">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不论我如何竭尽全力嘶吼呐喊</span></p><p begin="00:33.991" end="00:39.428" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:33.991" end="00:35.233">届</span><span begin="00:35.714" end="00:35.996">か</span><span begin="00:35.996" end="00:37.150">ない</span><span begin="00:37.418" end="00:37.751">か</span><span begin="00:37.751" end="00:39.428">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都无法将声音传达给你</span></p><p begin="00:40.701" end="00:43.958" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:40.701" end="00:41.236">We'd</span> <span begin="00:41.236" end="00:41.965">al</span><span begin="00:41.965" end="00:42.870">ready</span> <span begin="00:42.870" end="00:43.958">gone</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们早已与彼此走散</span></p><p begin="00:44.141" end="00:47.836" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:44.141" end="00:45.226">解</span><span begin="00:45.226" end="00:45.410">い</span><span begin="00:45.410" end="00:46.026">たっ</span><span begin="00:46.026" end="00:46.258">て</span><span begin="00:46.258" end="00:47.525">弱さ</span><span begin="00:47.525" end="00:47.836">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕就此释然 自身的软弱与寻觅你的声音</span></p><p begin="00:47.936" end="00:50.748" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:47.936" end="00:48.795">探</span><span begin="00:48.795" end="00:48.941">す</span><span begin="00:48.941" end="00:50.748">声が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">和那寻觅的声音</span></p><p begin="00:50.848" end="00:55.094" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:50.848" end="00:52.271">走馬灯み</span><span begin="00:52.271" end="00:52.805">たく</span><span begin="00:52.805" end="00:53.671">走っ</span><span begin="00:53.671" end="00:53.954">て</span><span begin="00:53.954" end="00:54.405">何</span><span begin="00:54.405" end="00:55.094">度も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都恍若走马灯在脑海中无数次流转驰骋</span></p><p begin="00:55.386" end="00:57.028" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:55.386" end="00:56.319">眺</span><span begin="00:56.319" end="00:56.602">め</span><span begin="00:56.602" end="00:57.028">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">远远眺望 沉溺其中</span></p><p begin="00:57.138" end="00:58.732" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="00:57.138" end="00:58.021">溺</span><span begin="00:58.021" end="00:58.306">れ</span><span begin="00:58.306" end="00:58.732">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">沉溺着</span></p><p begin="00:58.793" end="01:02.128" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="00:58.793" end="01:00.452">心を</span><span begin="01:00.622" end="01:01.241">枯ら</span><span begin="01:01.241" end="01:01.705">したっ</span><span begin="01:01.705" end="01:02.128">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不论如何竭尽了心力</span></p><p begin="01:02.284" end="01:05.967" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="01:02.284" end="01:03.591">過去に変</span><span begin="01:03.591" end="01:04.289">わる</span><span begin="01:04.289" end="01:05.967">二人</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你我两人也终成过往</span></p><p begin="01:05.967" end="01:08.777" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="01:05.967" end="01:06.567">So</span><span begin="01:06.567" end="01:06.858">meone's</span> <span begin="01:06.858" end="01:07.474">gotta</span> <span begin="01:07.474" end="01:08.777">go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总要有个人先一步离开</span></p><p begin="01:16.844" end="01:18.114" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="01:16.844" end="01:17.103">No</span> <span begin="01:17.103" end="01:18.114">light</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这条空荡荡的长路尽头没有光芒照亮</span></p><p begin="01:18.575" end="01:20.631" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="01:18.575" end="01:18.844">At</span> <span begin="01:18.844" end="01:18.993">the</span> <span begin="01:18.993" end="01:20.289">end</span> <span begin="01:20.292" end="01:20.631">of</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽头</span></p><p begin="01:20.631" end="01:23.161" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="01:20.631" end="01:22.066">This</span> <span begin="01:22.066" end="01:23.161">hollow</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再无光芒</span></p><p begin="01:23.660" end="01:24.898" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="01:23.660" end="01:24.898">風</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">寒风 让左脑变得愈发清醒</span></p><p begin="01:25.401" end="01:28.833" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="01:25.401" end="01:26.601">冴え</span><span begin="01:27.161" end="01:27.428">てい</span><span begin="01:27.428" end="01:28.833">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">左脑</span></p><p begin="01:28.833" end="01:30.073" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="01:28.833" end="01:29.143">左</span><span begin="01:29.143" end="01:30.073">脳</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愈发清醒</span></p><p begin="01:30.402" end="01:36.811" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="01:30.402" end="01:30.815">もう</span><span begin="01:30.815" end="01:32.215">ど</span><span begin="01:32.215" end="01:32.596">んな</span><span begin="01:32.596" end="01:33.564">に</span><span begin="01:33.770" end="01:35.759">叫</span><span begin="01:35.759" end="01:36.077">んで</span><span begin="01:36.077" end="01:36.811">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不论我如何竭尽全力嘶吼呐喊</span></p><p begin="01:37.391" end="01:41.992" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="01:37.391" end="01:38.687">届</span><span begin="01:39.140" end="01:39.490">か</span><span begin="01:39.490" end="01:40.420">ない</span><span begin="01:40.908" end="01:41.164">け</span><span begin="01:41.164" end="01:41.992">ど</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管声音都已无法传达</span></p><p begin="01:44.086" end="01:47.398" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="01:44.086" end="01:44.646">We'd</span> <span begin="01:44.646" end="01:45.395">al</span><span begin="01:45.395" end="01:46.227">ready</span> <span begin="01:46.227" end="01:47.398">gone</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们早已与彼此走散</span></p><p begin="01:47.558" end="01:51.362" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="01:47.558" end="01:48.707">解</span><span begin="01:48.707" end="01:48.875">い</span><span begin="01:48.875" end="01:49.491">たっ</span><span begin="01:49.491" end="01:49.691">て</span><span begin="01:49.691" end="01:51.041">弱さ</span><span begin="01:51.041" end="01:51.362">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕就此释然 自身的软弱与寻觅你的声音</span></p><p begin="01:51.453" end="01:54.183" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="01:51.453" end="01:52.157">探</span><span begin="01:52.157" end="01:52.357">す</span><span begin="01:52.357" end="01:54.183">声が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">和那寻觅的声音</span></p><p begin="01:54.387" end="01:58.633" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="01:54.387" end="01:55.810">走馬灯み</span><span begin="01:55.810" end="01:56.344">たく</span><span begin="01:56.344" end="01:57.210">走っ</span><span begin="01:57.210" end="01:57.493">て</span><span begin="01:57.493" end="01:57.944">何</span><span begin="01:57.944" end="01:58.633">度も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都恍若走马灯在脑海中无数次流转驰骋</span></p><p begin="01:58.864" end="02:00.438" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="01:58.864" end="01:59.664">眺</span><span begin="01:59.664" end="02:00.016">め</span><span begin="02:00.016" end="02:00.438">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">远远眺望 沉溺其中</span></p><p begin="02:00.557" end="02:02.189" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="02:00.557" end="02:01.456">溺</span><span begin="02:01.456" end="02:01.706">れ</span><span begin="02:01.706" end="02:02.189">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">沉溺着</span></p><p begin="02:02.311" end="02:05.601" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="02:02.311" end="02:03.833">心を</span><span begin="02:04.033" end="02:04.633">枯ら</span><span begin="02:04.633" end="02:05.100">したっ</span><span begin="02:05.100" end="02:05.601">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不论如何竭尽了心力</span></p><p begin="02:05.703" end="02:09.392" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="02:05.703" end="02:07.045">過去に変</span><span begin="02:07.045" end="02:07.545">わる</span><span begin="02:07.717" end="02:09.392">二人</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你我两人也终成过往</span></p><p begin="02:09.392" end="02:13.466" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L34"><span begin="02:09.392" end="02:10.035">So</span><span begin="02:10.035" end="02:10.235">meone's</span> <span begin="02:10.235" end="02:10.867">gotta</span> <span begin="02:10.867" end="02:13.466">go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总要有个人先一步离开</span></p><p begin="02:25.265" end="02:28.580" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L35"><span begin="02:25.265" end="02:25.929">We'd</span> <span begin="02:25.929" end="02:26.545">al</span><span begin="02:26.545" end="02:27.396">ready</span> <span begin="02:27.396" end="02:28.580">gone</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们早已与彼此走散</span></p><p begin="02:28.721" end="02:32.509" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L36"><span begin="02:28.721" end="02:29.791">解</span><span begin="02:29.791" end="02:29.975">い</span><span begin="02:29.975" end="02:30.641">たっ</span><span begin="02:30.641" end="02:30.823">て</span><span begin="02:30.823" end="02:32.156">弱さ</span><span begin="02:32.156" end="02:32.509">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕就此释然 自身的软弱与寻觅你的声音</span></p><p begin="02:32.570" end="02:35.466" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L37"><span begin="02:32.570" end="02:33.257">探</span><span begin="02:33.257" end="02:33.473">す</span><span begin="02:33.473" end="02:35.466">声が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">和那寻觅的声音</span></p><p begin="02:35.488" end="02:39.704" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38"><span begin="02:35.488" end="02:36.908">走馬灯み</span><span begin="02:36.908" end="02:37.445">たく</span><span begin="02:37.445" end="02:38.311">走っ</span><span begin="02:38.311" end="02:38.594">て</span><span begin="02:38.594" end="02:39.045">何</span><span begin="02:39.045" end="02:39.704">度も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都恍若走马灯在脑海中无数次流转驰骋</span></p><p begin="02:40.034" end="02:41.610" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L39"><span begin="02:40.034" end="02:40.837">眺</span><span begin="02:40.837" end="02:41.120">め</span><span begin="02:41.120" end="02:41.610">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">远远眺望 沉溺其中</span></p><p begin="02:41.711" end="02:43.327" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L40"><span begin="02:41.711" end="02:42.571">溺</span><span begin="02:42.571" end="02:42.837">れ</span><span begin="02:42.837" end="02:43.327">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">沉溺着</span></p><p begin="02:43.407" end="02:46.822" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L41"><span begin="02:43.407" end="02:44.951">心を</span><span begin="02:45.161" end="02:45.795">枯ら</span><span begin="02:45.795" end="02:46.227">したっ</span><span begin="02:46.227" end="02:46.822">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不论如何竭尽了心力</span></p><p begin="02:46.940" end="02:50.534" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L42"><span begin="02:46.940" end="02:48.167">過去に変</span><span begin="02:48.167" end="02:48.697">わる</span><span begin="02:48.850" end="02:50.534">二人</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你我两人也终成过往</span></p><p begin="02:50.534" end="02:54.570" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L43"><span begin="02:50.534" end="02:51.089">So</span><span begin="02:51.089" end="02:51.449">meone's</span> <span begin="02:51.449" end="02:52.022">gotta</span> <span begin="02:52.022" end="02:54.570">go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总要有个人先一步离开</span></p></div></body></tt>